    <node id="LUBOS MARINOS DE UNO Y DOS PELOS">
      <data key="d0">PINNIPED</data>
      <data key="d1"> Los lobos marinos de uno y dos pelos son especies de pinn&#237;pedos that inhabit the Atlantic and Fueguina coasts of our country, known for their social behavior and their habitat in colonies.</data>
