    <node id="POBLACI&#211;N">
      <data key="d0">NONE</data>
      <data key="d1"> The population of lobos marinos in the southwestern coast of the Bay of Thouctof is estimated to be approximately 55 adult lobos of both sexes. The population of lobos marinos along the southern coast of the Gulf of San Jorge is estimated to be 2940 lobos, with 2100 in the high tide zone, 240 in the mid tide zone, and 290 in the low tide zone. The lobos marinos are distributed across the islands of Blanca Este, Blanca Oeste, Moreno, and Vald&#233;s, with a total population of 10,000 lobos.</data>
      <data key="d2">542231ad71887d5ea52f251bd5ce2e3e,b936698b8bf77875919870e3152faf6d,d12aea8b41f8654da913712b1182332f</data>
