    </node>
    <node id="CARACTER&#205;STICAS">
      <data key="d0">NONE</data>
      <data key="d1"> The Car&#225;cter&#237;sticas de S.W. de la Bah&#237;a Thouctof are characterized by their temporariedad, mixedness, and population of lobos marinos. The costa sur del golfo de San Jorge is characterized by its permanency, mixed parition, and the fact that it is a displaced anchorage towards the west. The characteristics of pinn&#237;pedos include their reproduction, feeding, and adaptation to their environment.</data>
      <data key="d2">542231ad71887d5ea52f251bd5ce2e3e,b936698b8bf77875919870e3152faf6d,e411653fa84230bcd9ca8f9b38657cca</data>
